red ports), not just the coarse patch boxes.\"> Show fine voxels</label>\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Show fine voxels","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><label>Rotation °</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Rotation °","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Yaw — rotation about z. Composed R_z·R_y·R_x, the same as training's so3 draw.\">Yaw</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-yaw\">0</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Pitch — rotation about y.\">Pitch</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-pitch\">0</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Roll — rotation about x.\">Roll</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-roll\">0</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><label>Translation mm</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Translation mm","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Translation along x (mm).\">X</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-tx\">0.0</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Translation along y (mm).\">Y</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-ty\">0.0</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Translation along z (mm).\">Z</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-tz\">0.0</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><label title=\"Improper transform (mirror x): E→R·E while H→det(R)·R·H (axial, flips sign).\"> Reflect (mirror x)</label>\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Reflect (mirror x)","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"field-content\">\n\n  <details open id=\"model-overlay-section\">\n    <summary>Field Source</summary>\n    <div>\n      <p><label>Model</label>\n        \n      </p>\n      <p><label>Ckpt</label>\n        \n      </p>\n      <div>\n        <p><label>Show</label></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details open id=\"querypoints-section\">\n    <summary>Query Points</summary>\n    <div>\n      \n      \n      <div id=\"q-sampling-rows\">\n        <p>Points 10000</p>\n        <p>Airbox × 4.0</p>\n        <p><label>Seed</label>\n          \n          \n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"q-adaptive-rows\">\n        <p>Spread 0.10</p>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details open id=\"physics-section\">\n    <summary>Physics</summary>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <p><label>Field</label></p>\n      </div>\n      <p>Port Glow</p>\n      <p><label>Freq</label>\n        \n      </p>\n      <p><label>Phase</label>\n        \n        \n        \n      </p>\n      <p>Speed 3.00s</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details open id=\"fieldrender-section\">\n    <summary>Field Render</summary>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <p>QualityRender</p>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Render mode — Vectors uses the existing arrow primitives.\n           Streamlines re-integrates field lines per phase frame from the\n           voxelized scattered samples (animated geometry). -->\n      <div>\n        <p><label>Mode</label></p>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Far-field displacement slider — only meaningful when Far mode\n           is active. 0 = colored sphere, higher = bulgy antenna pattern. -->\n      \n      <p>Length Log</p>\n      <!-- Color by: built in JS via createLatexSelect so the option\n           labels render as math (|E|, E_x, E_y, E_z, φ). The shared\n           latex_select component handles the trigger/panel widget;\n           main.js owns the E/H/S option swap + the phi-disables-Log\n           sync. -->\n      <div>\n        <p>Color by</p>\n        <p><label id=\"lbl-log-color\">\n           Log\n        </label>\n      </p></div>\n      <!-- Slice locations. Colors each probe by the validation slicing axis it falls in, so a\n           per-slice metric in the report can be located in space. Options come from\n           /api/slice_labels (the server owns the axis list, not this markup). Clicking a\n           legend row isolates that bin. -->\n      <p>Slice by</p>\n      \n      <p>Vec size 1.0</p>\n      <p>Stream size 1.0</p>\n      <!-- Streamline tuning (streamline / polarization modes). Pulse animates\n           direction-of-flow dashes. Stop at metal enforces the conductor\n           boundary. Density = number of seeds (magnitude-weighted, so lines\n           cluster where the field is strong); Log density weighting compresses\n           that bias. Grid res sets voxel resolution (detail, fixed footprint). -->\n      <p>Pulse streamline</p>\n      <p>Stop at metal</p>\n      <p>Log density weighting</p>\n      <p>Density 2048</p>\n      <p>Seed mag floor 2.0%</p>\n      <p>Grid res 128</p>\n      <p>Colormap</p>\n      <!-- Grid of gradient swatches — visual preview is the picker. The\n           active swatch gets an accent ring; clicking a different swatch\n           updates State.colormap immediately. -->\n      \n    </div>\n  </details>\n  </div><div id=\"geometry-content\">\n\n  \n\n  <!-- Cut the geometry with a plane of any orientation. The clip is a GPU material clip, so\n       scrubbing the plane is free; the cut outline comes from /api/zslice, debounced. -->\n\n  <p>表面</p>\n  <p><label> Edges</label>\n  </p>\n  <p>Points 4.0</p>\n  <p>措施</p>\n  <p>Integral paths + patch (S-param)</p>\n\n  <!-- Opening the expander IS enabling the cross-section: a disclosure that reveals a\n       checkbox you then have to tick is two gestures for one intent. The plane is always\n       axis-aligned, so the only ways to move it are the axis buttons, the offset, and\n       dragging its face. -->\n  <details id=\"xsec-section\">\n    <summary>Cross-section</summary>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <p>普通的</p>\n      </div>\n      <p>抵消</p>\n      <p>Hide geometry</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details id=\"densify-section\">\n        <summary>Densify<span aria-label=\"Beta feature\">BETA</span></summary>\n        <div>\n          <p>Face pts 4096</p>\n          <p>Tet pts 4096</p>\n          <p><label>Seed</label>\n            \n            \n          </p>\n          <p>Area/volume weighted</p>\n          <p>Upsample pts</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <!-- Voxels mode controls (shown only when the Voxels geometry mode is active). -->\n      <div id=\"voxel-section\">\n          <p>解决</p>\n          <p><label title=\"Voxels per patch edge — patch³ voxels group into one patch; empty patches are dropped.\">Patch</label>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p>Extent ±mm 8</p>\n          <p>Show fine voxels</p>\n          \n      </div>\n\n      <details id=\"transform-section\">\n        <summary>Transform<span aria-label=\"Beta feature\">BETA</span></summary>\n        <div>\n          <p>Rotation °</p>\n          <p><label title=\"Yaw — rotation about z. Composed R_z·R_y·R_x, the same as training's so3 draw.\">Yaw</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-yaw\">0</span>\n          </p>\n          <p><label title=\"Pitch — rotation about y.\">Pitch</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-pitch\">0</span>\n          </p>\n          <p><label title=\"Roll — rotation about x.\">Roll</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-roll\">0</span>\n          </p>\n          <p>Translation mm</p>\n          <p><label title=\"Translation along x (mm).\">X</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-tx\">0.0</span>\n          </p>\n          <p><label title=\"Translation along y (mm).\">Y</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-ty\">0.0</span>\n          </p>\n          <p><label title=\"Translation along z (mm).\">Z</label>\n            \n            <span id=\"val-e3-tz\">0.0</span>\n          </p>\n          <p>Reflect (mirror x)</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n  </div></div>"}